# Specs, plans, and notes written for this project by the assistant. Kept on
# disk for local reference, never published.
/docs/
/tasks/
/revisi.md

# Regenerated by `next dev` on every start; ignored so it never shows up as a
# stray change in a diff.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

# Stale npm lockfile. This project installs with Bun, so bun.lock is the one
# that counts and CI uses `bun install --frozen-lockfile`.
/package-lock.json
